am/apps/3299920/extras/ec8bafaff0d163c378003608ac89d001.webm?t=1753672871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299920/extras/ec8bafaff0d163c378003608ac89d001.mp4?t=1753672871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Visuals</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A striking isometric perspective with detailed environments and dynamic lighting that brings the world of <i>Liminal Point</i> to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299920/extras/9938f6eef38752b3168ec3043184afa5.poster.avif?t=1753672871\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299920/extras/9938f6eef38752b3168ec3043184afa5.webm?t=1753672871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299920/extras/9938f6eef38752b3168ec3043184afa5.mp4?t=1753672871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evocative Sound Design</strong><br>A chilling original soundtrack and ambient audio immerse you in the tension of the island\u2019s desolate hall, abandoned mansion and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299920/extras/a2b4ef09d35acb7b7e4000efb453a858.poster.avif?t=1753672871\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299920/extras/a2b4ef09d35acb7b7e4000efb453a858.webm?t=1753672871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299920/extras/a2b4ef09d35acb7b7e4000efb453a858.mp4?t=1753672871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to uncover the secrets of <i>Liminal Point</i>. But remember: the truth comes at a cost.</p>",
